I"<<h1 id="live-acoustic-neural-harmonizer">Live Acoustic Neural Harmonizer</h1>
<p><br />
When creating musical ideas, it is often hard to concepualize the full scope of harmonies and rhythms when working by oneself. Having new background ideas availble in real-time greatly expands the freedom and flexibility musicians have when demoing and/or tinkering with ideas, even with just a single instrument or voice. This project aims to create a real-time system that can take a live audio signal from any instrument and generate real-time harmonies with the help of MIDI.</p>
